Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: mchp-i2s-mcc: make signed 1 bit bitfields unsigned
Date:   Wed, 25 Mar 2020 13:29:13 +0000
Message-Id: <20200325132913.110115-1-colin.king@canonical.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.1
MIME-Version: 1.0
